   "text": "EVERY AGENT IS A PURE FUNCTION\n\none shot \u00b7 no tools \u00b7 no loop\nno memory \u00b7 temperature 0\nJSON in \u2192 JSON out \u2192 exit\n\nif it needs a second turn,\nthe PROMPT is wrong.\n\nevidence span required on\nevery extracted field.",
