   "index": "b0113",
   "text": "13 \u00b7 DISPLAYED SCORE  0\u2013100  =  100 \u00d7 c \u00d7 mean(effect, form, dose)\ninternal signed \u2212100\u2026+100 = 100 \u00d7 d \u00d7 c \u00d7 (1 \u2212 0.4H)\nconfidence MULTIPLIES: if we barely know anything, nothing else matters",
   "originalText": "13 \u00b7 DISPLAYED SCORE  0\u2013100  =  100 \u00d7 c \u00d7 mean(effect, form, dose)\ninternal signed \u2212100\u2026+100 = 100 \u00d7 d \u00d7 c \u00d7 (1 \u2212 0.4H)\nconfidence MULTIPLIES: if we barely know anything, nothing else matters",
