   "index": "b0116",
   "text": "14 \u00b7 REPORT \u2192  reports/runs/  +  INDEX.md  +  latest.md\nstamped with scoring_model and the provider that extracted it\none row per outcome, sorted by evidence mass",
   "originalText": "14 \u00b7 REPORT \u2192  reports/runs/  +  INDEX.md  +  latest.md\nstamped with scoring_model and the provider that extracted it\none row per outcome, sorted by evidence mass",
   "fontSize": 15,
