  {
   "id": "Dnv_7edeVtKbhOHtMYAop",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 2134,
   "y": 339.5,
   "width": 537.6,
   "height": 262.5,
   "angle": 0,
   "strokeColor": "#6741d9",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 2,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 1,
   "opacity": 100,
   "groupIds": [],
   "frameId": null,
   "roundness": null,
   "seed": 1594872105,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 1655295697,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "boundElements": [],
   "updated": 1785777351988,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "index": "b0128",
   "text": "GROK MODEL TIERS\n----------------\n  A   S1, S8              grok-4.3    simple classification\n  B   S2,S3,S4,S5,S7      grok-4.5    adversarial extraction\n  C   S6                  grok-4.5    fewest hallucinations\n\nS6 is ~5 of the ~10 calls per study, so tier C is the\ndominant cost -- not tier A.\n\n  120-study run:  all 4.5              $9.48\n                  A -> 4.3             $9.10   4%\n                  + C -> 4.20-reason   $7.21  24%   <- the lever\n\nTier B moves only after an A/B on the 28 anchors.\nSPEC 15: tiers are a prior, not a measurement.",
   "originalText": "GROK MODEL TIERS\n----------------\n  A   S1, S8              grok-4.3    simple classification\n  B   S2,S3,S4,S5,S7      grok-4.5    adversarial extraction\n  C   S6                  grok-4.5    fewest hallucinations\n\nS6 is ~5 of the ~10 calls per study, so tier C is the\ndominant cost -- not tier A.\n\n  120-study run:  all 4.5              $9.48\n                  A -> 4.3             $9.10   4%\n                  + C -> 4.20-reason   $7.21  24%   <- the lever\n\nTier B moves only after an A/B on the 28 anchors.\nSPEC 15: tiers are a prior, not a measurement.",
   "fontSize": 14,
   "fontFamily": 3,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "autoResize": true,
   "lineHeight": 1.25
  },
  {
   "id": "PVE9jIKYBF2QLurhL77LV",
